---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legionella Risk Assessments in Glasgow | Scottish Energy Services"
  description="Request a Glasgow Legionella risk assessment for rental and managed properties. Scottish Energy Services offers practical, clear reporting."
  canonicalPath="/legionella-risk-assessment-glasgow"
>
  <section class="py-12">
    <div class="container-pro max-w-4xl space-y-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Legionella risk assessments in Glasgow</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        For landlords and property managers in Glasgow, Scottish Energy Services offers Legionella risk assessments focused on the
        water systems and usage patterns that matter in day-to-day property management.
      </p>
      <div class="quote-card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Typical assessment focus</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-slate-700 space-y-1">
          <li>Stored hot and cold water systems, including tanks where present.</li>
          <li>Infrequently used outlets and areas of potential water stagnation.</li>
          <li>Property-specific notes to support landlord records and follow-up actions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        Use the <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/#quote">quote and booking form</a> to request your Glasgow visit.
      </p>
      <p class="text-slate-700">
        You may also want an <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/epc-glasgow">EPC assessment in Glasgow</a> or compare
        <a class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900" href="/legionella-risk-assessment-edinburgh">Legionella coverage in Edinburgh</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
